{"title":"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the coefficient of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/5/025ba613998d75618918f9a14a5c382461f8c5c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^3y^{13}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"40\" height=\"18\" /> in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/f/04f0f287b2c97f6f7cfb9c104cd4df2ffffe312d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(\\frac 12x + y\\right)^{17}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"94\" height=\"46\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Binomial_expansion\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Binomial expansion\">binomial expansion</a>, the sum of the degrees of the power of each of the two terms must sum to the power being raised to, here <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/6/b7616a230c77f0d9a577e5bca01aa06f1c35c457.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. However, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/0/5a06b78f5e5bce3d66ff4ccfd557470bc6be4f8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 + 13 = 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"91\" height=\"14\" />, contradiction; so there does not exist such a term, and the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/3/9638a2fb54252802ab074ba404909a73fad1ef74.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008\">Mock AIME 1 2007-2008</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems\">Problems</a></b>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?t=196980\">Source</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018013023\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.016 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.021 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 92/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1402/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 202/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 915/5000000 bytes\n-->\n